+    // MoE routing-weight fold: one f32 per (token, expert slot), and ids_dst[j]
+    // is exactly that flat index into the weight vector. It is a separate loop
+    // rather than a conditional inside the stock one because a conditional
+    // global load in the unrolled store loop costs ~1.3% on EVERY MMQ launch in
+    // the build, fold firing or not (measured against a same-source control).
